      <details class="group p-4">
        <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">
          Quelle commande lancer pour valider le projet ?
          <span class="text-xl leading-none text-gray-500 group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
          La commande de test courante est
          <code class="rounded bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 font-mono">docker compose exec sentinel-api bundle exec rspec</code>.
          Pour tout valider avant commit, utilisez
          <code class="rounded bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 font-mono">docker compose exec sentinel-api bin/ci</code>.
